@startuml
title Deployment View

node "Local Docker" {
  node "api container" {
    component "Node Express API" as LocalAPI
    component "Python venv\nml_service" as LocalPy
  }
  database "mongo:7\nlocal volume" as LocalMongo
}

cloud "Production Host\n(Render not confirmed in repo)" as Prod {
  node "Node runtime/container" {
    component "Express API" as ProdAPI
    component "Python Dev2Vec" as ProdPy
  }
}

database "MongoDB\nprovider unknown/Atlas compatible" as ProdMongo
cloud "GitHub API" as GitHub
cloud "Gemini-compatible LLM" as Gemini
cloud "YouTube API" as YT

LocalAPI --> LocalMongo : MONGO_URI
LocalAPI --> LocalPy : execFile
ProdAPI --> ProdMongo : MONGO_URI or MONGODB_URI
ProdAPI --> ProdPy : execFile
ProdAPI --> GitHub : OAuth/REST
ProdAPI --> Gemini : HTTPS
ProdAPI --> YT : HTTPS

note right of Prod
No render.yaml was found.
Render deployment is UNKNOWN from source only.
end note

legend
Local Docker is confirmed by Dockerfile/docker-compose.
Production details need external deployment evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
